            "Connect a mailing-list service once; then any form can add the people who fill it in to one of your lists (the form block's settings \u2192 After sending). Keys are checked with the service, stored encrypted on this site and never shown again.": [
                "P\u0159ipojte slu\u017ebu e-mailov\u00fdch konferenc\u00ed jednou; pot\u00e9 m\u016f\u017ee jak\u00fdkoli formul\u00e1\u0159 p\u0159idat osoby, kter\u00e9 jej vypln\u00ed, do jednoho z Va\u0161ich seznam\u016f (nastaven\u00ed bloku formul\u00e1\u0159e \u2192 Po odesl\u00e1n\u00ed). Kl\u00ed\u010de jsou ov\u011b\u0159eny u slu\u017eby, ulo\u017eeny na tomto webu v za\u0161ifrovan\u00e9 podob\u011b a ji\u017e se znovu nezobraz\u00ed."
            ],
            "Send form submissions and button clicks to your analytics with no code. Leave an ID empty to skip that service. Buttons get a \"Conversion event\" field in their Advanced panel. With the cookie banner on, nothing loads until the visitor agrees.": [
                "Odes\u00edlejte odesl\u00e1n\u00ed formul\u00e1\u0159\u016f a kliknut\u00ed na tla\u010d\u00edtka do sv\u00fdch analytick\u00fdch n\u00e1stroj\u016f bez pou\u017eit\u00ed k\u00f3du. Chcete-li danou slu\u017ebu p\u0159esko\u010dit, ponechte ID pr\u00e1zdn\u00e9. Tla\u010d\u00edtka z\u00edskaj\u00ed pole \u201eKonverzn\u00ed ud\u00e1lost\u201c ve sv\u00e9m pokro\u010dil\u00e9m panelu. P\u0159i zapnut\u00e9 li\u0161t\u011b s cookies se nic nena\u010dte, dokud n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvn\u00edk neud\u011bl\u00ed souhlas."
            ],
