            "Switch off if your theme or another plugin already adds them; events are still sent.": [
                "Vypn\u011bte, pokud je va\u0161e \u0161ablona nebo jin\u00fd plugin ji\u017e p\u0159id\u00e1v\u00e1; ud\u00e1losti se budou odes\u00edlat i nad\u00e1le."
