            "Event name for form submissions": [
                "N\u00e1zev ud\u00e1losti pro odesl\u00e1n\u00ed formul\u00e1\u0159\u016f"
            ],
            "The banner is a popup you design with blocks. Its buttons link to #consent-accept, #consent-reject and #consent-save (with tick boxes named analytics and marketing for \"save\"); a link to #consent-open anywhere shows it again. Until a visitor accepts, tracking tags do not load, Google Consent Mode stays \"denied\", and the scripts you list stay switched off.": [
                "Banner je vyskakovac\u00ed okno, kter\u00e9 navrhnete pomoc\u00ed blok\u016f. Jeho tla\u010d\u00edtka odkazuj\u00ed na #consent-accept, #consent-reject a #consent-save (se za\u0161krt\u00e1vac\u00edmi pol\u00ed\u010dky nazvan\u00fdmi analytics a marketing pro \u201esave\u201c); odkaz na #consent-open kdekoli jej znovu zobraz\u00ed. Dokud n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvn\u00edk nesouhlas\u00ed, m\u011b\u0159ic\u00ed zna\u010dky se nena\u010dtou, Google Consent Mode z\u016fstane ve stavu \u201edenied\u201c a skripty, kter\u00e9 uvedete, z\u016fstanou vypnut\u00e9."
            ],
            "Create a ready-made banner": [
                "Vytvo\u0159it p\u0159edp\u0159ipraven\u00fd banner"
            ],
