            ],
            "Outside the European Union, the EEA and the UK: load tracking until the visitor says no": [
                "Mimo Evropskou unii, EHP a Spojen\u00e9 kr\u00e1lovstv\u00ed: na\u010d\u00edtat sledov\u00e1n\u00ed, dokud n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvn\u00edk neodm\u00edtne"
            ],
            "Off: every visitor must agree first (the strictest rule, and the default). On: only when your host or CDN reports the visitor's country (for example Cloudflare's CF-IPCountry header) and it is outside the EU, EEA, UK and Switzerland. The banner is still shown, and an unknown country is treated as inside the EU.": [
                "Vypnuto: ka\u017ed\u00fd n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvn\u00edk mus\u00ed nejprve souhlasit (nejp\u0159\u00edsn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed pravidlo a v\u00fdchoz\u00ed hodnota). Zapnuto: pouze v p\u0159\u00edpad\u011b, \u017ee v\u00e1\u0161 hosting nebo CDN nahl\u00e1s\u00ed zemi n\u00e1v\u0161t\u011bvn\u00edka (nap\u0159\u00edklad z\u00e1hlav\u00ed CF-IPCountry od Cloudflare) a tato zem\u011b je mimo EU, EHP, Spojen\u00e9 kr\u00e1lovstv\u00ed a \u0160v\u00fdcarsko. Banner se st\u00e1le zobrazuje a nezn\u00e1m\u00e1 zem\u011b je pova\u017eov\u00e1na za zemi v r\u00e1mci EU."
            ],
